{"src":"ro","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":208100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ro","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9334.790407,"text":"Dar, după ce a pierdut avantajul capitanului, India a făcut doar 36 de curse, pierdând 7 porți până la finalul repreziei."},{"kind":"text","t":9824.885804,"text":"But, after losing the captain's advantage, India faced only 36 balls, losing 7 wickets by the end of the innings."},{"kind":"audio","t":9886.533653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9888.168615999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":9889.37228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9890.904101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9892.527934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9894.34647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9894.8406,"samples":20592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":17650.065318,"text":"De obicei, au oferit o specială de mâncare, băutură și divertisment pentru a păstra buna dispoziție și oaspeții să rămână în local."},{"kind":"text","t":18114.50501,"text":"Usually, they offered a special of food, drink, and entertainment to keep the mood high and ensure guests stayed at the establishment."},{"kind":"audio","t":18177.323633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18178.882333999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18180.368434,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18181.953806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18183.708861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18185.198071,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18186.021897,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":27504.68477,"text":"Del Potro a avut primul avantaj în setul secund, dar și acesta a necesitat un tie-break după ce s-a ajuns la 6-6."},{"kind":"text","t":28013.444443,"text":"Del Potro had the first advantage in the second set, but this one also required a tie-break after it reached 6-6."},{"kind":"audio","t":28072.725644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28074.496059,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28075.969749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28077.700463999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28079.345207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28080.613492,"samples":29960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":34730.915219,"text":"Internetul combina elemente de comunicație în masă și interpersonală."},{"kind":"text","t":34947.330827000005,"text":"The internet combined elements of mass and interpersonal communication."},{"kind":"audio","t":35002.478215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35004.163119000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35005.722231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":35007.531297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":35007.66233000001,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":49278.827824,"text":"Compoziția acestor cristale se potrivește cu acelor întâlnite în urina animalelor de companie afectate atunci când sunt comparate printr-o spectroscopie în infraroșu, spectroscopie în IMS."},{"kind":"text","t":49693.364434,"text":"The composition of these crystals matches those found in the urine of affected pets when compared using infrared spectroscopy and IMS spectroscopy."},{"kind":"audio","t":49757.816729000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49759.198117,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49760.800159000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49762.388881000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":49763.984643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49765.62482600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49767.183217000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49768.874061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":49769.009724,"samples":7856,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":57801.270598,"text":"Pe unele rute, companiile mai mari dețin propriile avioane, dar alte rute și companiile mai mici aveau o problemă."},{"kind":"text","t":58208.556022000004,"text":"On some routes, the larger companies own their own aircraft, but other routes and smaller companies had a problem."},{"kind":"audio","t":58267.106619000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":58268.523477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58269.968236,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":58271.500617000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58273.128800000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58274.253522000006,"samples":25760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":66715.359042,"text":"Unii atomi au nuclee instabile, ceea ce înseamnă că țin să se descompună cu un impuls mic sau fără impuls."},{"kind":"text","t":67107.557432,"text":"Some atoms have unstable nuclei, which means they tend to decay with a small impulse or without an impulse."},{"kind":"audio","t":67166.336503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67167.828823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":67169.49041700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":480,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67171.16696100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67172.76006300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67174.171291,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":77763.184269,"text":"În cursul aceleiași luni, un alt avion a ieșit de pistă în Mașad, lovind un zid, ceea ce a adus la decesul a 17 persoane."},{"kind":"text","t":78299.297252,"text":"During the same month, another plane ran off the runway in Mashhad, hitting a wall, which resulted in the deaths of 17 people."},{"kind":"audio","t":78359.93618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":78365.344889,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78370.65685500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78375.737977,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78380.010823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78383.545644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78385.910262,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":85363.403213,"text":"Acestea sunt aproape toate plaje nisipoase, unde se poate nota in siguranta."},{"kind":"text","t":85628.247544,"text":"These are almost all sandy beaches, where one can swim safely."},{"kind":"audio","t":85680.618507,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85681.98554400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":85683.618147,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85684.32497100001,"samples":18696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":90548.468788,"text":"iar majoritatea au parte de umbră de la copacii Pohutu Kava."},{"kind":"text","t":90820.853951,"text":"and most of them have shade from the Pohutu Kava trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":90872.389996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":90873.943138,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90875.63938200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":90875.727373,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100393.071838,"text":"Printre sporturile populare se numără fotbalul, basketul, voleiul, polona, apă, scrima, rugbyul,"},{"kind":"text","t":100728.825295,"text":"Popular sports include football, basketball, volleyball, polo, swimming, fencing, and rugby."},{"kind":"audio","t":100784.283899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100785.81733,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100787.433212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100789.10172600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100790.603986,"samples":31528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":105461.935979,"text":"ciclismul, hocheiul pe gheață, hocheiul pe role și cursele de Formula 1."},{"kind":"text","t":105734.373533,"text":"cycling, ice hockey, roller hockey, and Formula 1 racing."},{"kind":"audio","t":105774.99776900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105776.440678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105778.087471,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105778.635262,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"input","t":112143.600225,"text":"În climatul cald din Orientul Mijlociu, casa era mai puțin importantă."},{"kind":"text","t":112433.071402,"text":"In the warm climate of the Middle East, the house was less important."},{"kind":"audio","t":112485.822062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112487.517226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112489.17593900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112489.73379,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":119936.593412,"text":"Arhiteclul este situat la 120 km spre nordul peniziului."},{"kind":"text","t":120210.132648,"text":"The archive is located 120 km north of the peninsula."},{"kind":"audio","t":120264.384969,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120265.73081600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120267.380299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":120268.767657,"samples":30096,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":125434.652096,"text":"Cea mai mare este insula King George cu asezarea Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"text","t":125752.603525,"text":"The largest is King George Island, with the settlement of Villa Las Estrellas."},{"kind":"audio","t":125807.89591600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125809.385746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":125810.967648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125812.896266,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":125813.025889,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":133522.5958,"text":"Sucul de varză își schimbă culoarea în funcție cât de acidă sau de bazică, alcalină și substanța chimică."},{"kind":"text","t":133874.796167,"text":"Cabbage juice changes color depending on how acidic or basic, alkaline, and the chemical substance."},{"kind":"audio","t":133932.392814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133933.912435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133935.517307,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":133937.018787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":133938.65211,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133939.217561,"samples":15560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":143832.941129,"text":"Podul este programat a fi pe deplin funcțional în septembrie 2017, când punctele de control VAMAL brazilene se așteaptă să fie terminate."},{"kind":"text","t":144340.973317,"text":"The bridge is scheduled to be fully functional in September 2017, when the Brazilian VAMAL checkpoints are expected to be completed."},{"kind":"audio","t":144411.024965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144412.609366,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144414.510915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144416.105297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144417.79223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":144419.44679400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144421.091747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144421.852162,"samples":19624,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":149638.52025200002,"text":"Umiditatea prezentă pe mâini va reacționa cu straturile exterioare."},{"kind":"text","t":149901.977396,"text":"The moisture present on the hands will react with the outer layers."},{"kind":"audio","t":149954.171005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149955.585223,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149957.159065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":149957.800458,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":154865.86638700002,"text":"ceea ce vă poate da o senzație ciudată și duce la formarea unui fel de crustă."},{"kind":"text","t":155204.059562,"text":"which may give you a strange sensation and lead to the formation of a kind of crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":155247.051416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":155248.583177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":155250.181279,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155252.017936,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":155252.248061,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":162153.47070900002,"text":"Una dintre bombe a explodat în fața biroului governatorului general."},{"kind":"text","t":162440.146839,"text":"One of the bombs exploded in front of the governor general's office."},{"kind":"audio","t":162493.456671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162494.856769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162496.505472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":162497.130954,"samples":17496,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":173533.677495,"text":"Sultanul marocan a reconstruit orașul sub numele de Daru-i-badia, iar numele de Casablanca a fost dat de către negustorii spanioli."},{"kind":"text","t":174012.552877,"text":"The Moroccan sultan rebuilt the city under the name Daru-i-badia, and the name Casablanca was given by Spanish merchants."},{"kind":"audio","t":174073.663745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174075.114764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174076.777438,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174078.434781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174080.093944,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174082.041464,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":174084.54307400002,"samples":17592,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":177401.307599,"text":"care stabiliseră acolo baze comerciale."},{"kind":"text","t":177548.56817800002,"text":"who established trading bases there."},{"kind":"audio","t":177597.745456,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177599.535722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":177599.649504,"samples":3464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":189325.781251,"text":"A fost întâmpinat de viceprim ministrul Singaporeului, Wong Kang-Seng, și a purtat discuții cu privire la comerț și terorism cu primul ministru al Singaporeului,"},{"kind":"text","t":189872.633949,"text":"He was welcomed by Singapore's Deputy Prime Minister, Wong Kang-Seng, and held discussions regarding trade and terrorism with the Prime Minister of Singapore,"},{"kind":"audio","t":189933.981872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189935.38547,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189936.87179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189938.583564,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":189940.225527,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189941.85853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189943.509763,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189945.261668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":189945.36084,"samples":4256,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":200816.02222800002,"text":"Bomba de fisiune funcționează conform principiului că este nevoie de energie pentru a asambla un nucleu cu mulți protoni și neutroni."},{"kind":"text","t":201206.79581,"text":"A fission bomb works on the principle that energy is required to assemble a nucleus with many protons and neutrons."},{"kind":"audio","t":201266.966999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201268.53797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201270.176653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201271.843017,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":201273.466089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201275.223575,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":201275.31237600002,"samples":3792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207151.848686,"text":"În arhipelaguri și lacuri nu aveți neapărat nevoie de un iaht."},{"kind":"text","t":207463.208942,"text":"In archipelagos and lakes, you don't necessarily need a yacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":207504.94909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207506.174495,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207507.791137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207508.42791,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"close","t":218105.9483,"code":1005}]}